        "content_type": "text/plain",
        "body": "ID: 314 - Shannon Hong (shannon.hong@seattlechildrens.org) from Seattle Children's Research Institute on 2024-10-04\nTopic: I'm a clinical research coordinator working with Dr. Caitlin Murray at Seattle Children's Research Institute and we are looking for a platform to help us develop a mobile-based just-in-time adaptive intervention and test in a pilot micro-randomized trial. We came across your company in this scoping review paper (https://www.psycnet.org/record/2025-28372-001), which highlighted many JITAI-related features that you offer, and we wanted to see if your company would be able to deliver a mobile-based JITAI/MRT. Thanks and we look forward to hearing back from you!\n",
